WEBVTT

00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:00.226
Vicky pushed her away too.

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:02.268
The neighbor seemed stunned,

00:02:02.292 --> 00:02:03.976
a little put off,

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.292
and she walked back out.

00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:08.559
Then, to make matters worse,

00:02:08.583 --> 00:02:10.476
the medical examiner's office,

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:13.893
carrying the body bag holding her husband,

00:02:13.917 --> 00:02:17.309
dropped it down a flight of stairs,

00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:19.708
crashing into a decorative end table.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.393
I will never forget the sound of her voice

00:02:24.417 --> 00:02:26.042
when she looked at me and said,

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.708
"I wish I never called."

00:02:29.917 --> 00:02:31.250
I felt awful.